      "inconsistency_hints": [
        "The Main Flow ends at acknowledging the alarm and applying the optional silence, but it contains no system response step that records the acknowledgment in the Device Command Log or System Operation Command Log with the required fields. Therefore the logging postconditions are not reached by the described flow.",
        "The active-alarm precondition does not establish that the alarm is still unacknowledged; an active alarm can already be acknowledged, so the trigger/postcondition transition to 'acknowledged' is not guaranteed to start from a valid prior state."
      ]
    }
